{"scene_description":"The image depicts an indoor space, likely a modern café or restaurant. The room features a large circular bookshelf in the center, with multiple levels of books and shelves. There are several tables and chairs arranged around the room, some occupied by people. A prominent feature is a large screen displaying a close-up image of a person's face. The ceiling has recessed lighting, and there is a purple wall on one side of the room. Large windows allow natural light to enter, creating a bright atmosphere. The floor appears to be made of polished tiles, reflecting the light from above."}

